| id | on | label (`say`) | fx (kit) |
|---|---|---|---|
| `mouldy` | cheese | "the green cheese" | tint #86b83c, stink |
| `wilted` | lettuce | "the brown lettuce" | tint #7a5a2a, droop, stink |
| `charred` | bacon | "the burnt bacon" | tint #2a1a12, smoke |
| `hair` | lettuce, tomato, pickles, onion, cheese | "{name} with a hair on it" | hair |
| `fly` | lettuce, tomato, pickles, onion, cheese, bacon | "{name} with a fly on it" | fly (the page plays `buzz`) |

Each needs Mitch's `gross.<id>` and the customers' `complain.gross.<id>` (written). None sits on the fryer or drinks;
a burnt patty or fries is Timed's last stage. Unchanged from the Burger Bar.

