| `plate` | `plate` | | the blue-rimmed plate (the board builds on it) |
| `fries` | `fries` | colour #f2c14e | fries, raw to burnt; a paper boat on their own (layout `boat`) |
| `rings` | `onionRings` | colour #d99a3a | battered rings, raw to burnt (boat) |
| `salt` | `sprinkle` | colour #ffffff | grains over the food; waits in a shaker |
