| panelTop, panelBottom, panelLip | #c9d1d8, #8d969e, #4d545a | the line's control panel and its lip |
| plateTop, plateBottom | #f2f4f6, #b9c2c9 | the dial plates |
| mark | #6b3a22 | a plate's stage marks |
| labelBg | rgba(27,18,14,.86) | prop labels |
| ticketAccent, ticketNow, perforation | #8a2a20, #fff2a8, #c9c1b0 | the ticket's name, current line, torn edge |
| hudBg, gaugeBg | rgba(27,18,14,.75), rgba(27,18,14,.86) | HUD, Timed gauge |
| star | #f0a500 | stars |
| boardGlow, woodInset, cardValue, board, wood | #2f4a3f, #5e3b20, #ffe27a, #23382f, #8a5a32 | the menu boards |
